{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 2.763636,
      "text": "In Boston, a giant tank of molasses"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 2.909091,
      "end_seconds": 5.018182,
      "text": "stood beside a residential neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 5.090909,
      "end_seconds": 6.909091,
      "text": "It had been leaking for so long"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 7.018182,
      "end_seconds": 9.309091,
      "text": "that children collected the sweet drips in"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 9.563636,
      "end_seconds": 10.181818,
      "text": "buckets."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 10.290909,
      "end_seconds": 13.527273,
      "text": "On January fifteenth, nineteen nineteen, the tank"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 13.745455,
      "end_seconds": 14.472727,
      "text": "burst."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 14.581818,
      "end_seconds": 16.654545,
      "text": "A wave of molasses rushed through the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 16.763636,
      "end_seconds": 18.836364,
      "text": "streets, destroying buildings."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.981818,
      "end_seconds": 21.454545,
      "text": "Twenty-one people died, and around one hundred"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 21.563636,
      "end_seconds": 22.981818,
      "text": "and fifty were injured."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 23.054545,
      "end_seconds": 24.945455,
      "text": "The company that owned the tank claimed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 25.018182,
      "end_seconds": 26.4,
      "text": "someone had blown it up."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 26.472727,
      "end_seconds": 28.145455,
      "text": "But how could that explain a tank"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 28.218182,
      "end_seconds": 29.963636,
      "text": "that had leaked for years?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 30.145455,
      "end_seconds": 32.509091,
      "text": "After years of legal proceedings, the company"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 32.618182,
      "end_seconds": 33.963636,
      "text": "was held responsible."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 34.036364,
      "end_seconds": 35.854545,
      "text": "The tank had been poorly built, and"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 35.963636,
      "end_seconds": 37.672727,
      "text": "signs of danger had not been properly"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 37.890909,
      "end_seconds": 38.545455,
      "text": "addressed."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 38.618182,
      "end_seconds": 40.581818,
      "text": "The warning had been visible before the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 40.654545,
      "end_seconds": 41.236364,
      "text": "disaster."
    }
  ]
}
